Package: lustrum
Title: Structure Checks for Register Microdata
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Check that register microdata has the structure an analysis
    assumes: unique keys, balanced panels without gaps, spells that do not
    overlap, and turn spell data into period panels with primo and ultimo
    status. Built for full-population registers: keys are grouped in one
    linear pass without sorting them, spell lookups run in compiled code,
    and database and Arrow tables are checked where they live.
